OL,3,AJapan beer giants raided over alleged
OL,4,Aprice-fixing cartel
OL,5,
OL,6,FJapanese officials have raided the
OL,7,Fcountry's biggest beer makers over
OL,8,Fallegations they worked together to
OL,9,Fraise the price of their beverages.
OL,11,FAsahi, Sapporo, Kirin and Suntory
OL,12,FSpirits confirmed to the BBC that their
OL,13,Fpremises had been searched by the Japan
OL,14,FFair Trade Commission (JFTC), adding
OL,15,Fthat they would fully cooperate with
OL,16,Fthe regulator.
OL,18,FThe four firms dominate Japan's beer
OL,19,Fmarket, with their drinks a common
OL,20,Fsight in supermarkets and convenience
OL,21,Fstores across the country.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
